Dual-License Notice for Argus-paper-reader
==========================================

This project (https://github.com/lryorb/Argus-paper-reader) is distributed
under a dual-licensing architecture designed for open-source tooling and
unrestricted academic knowledge sharing:

1. Software, Scripts, & Interactive UI Code -> MIT License
   All executable code, build scripts (including `scripts/build_html.py`),
