   and all annotated HTML reports or reading notes generated by users with this
   skill are dedicated to the public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0
   Universal. See the `LICENSE-CC0` file for the full legal text.

Unless explicitly stated otherwise for a specific file or directory, any
ambiguity in license applicability defaults to the MIT License (`LICENSE-MIT`).
